  "description": "Refactor step M7, class A (docs/plans/codebase-refactor.md §6.5, K1 and K3 in §4.3): internal/api's agent_handlers.go splits along its // --- section markers into one file per area and keeps only registerAgentRoutes. Each section's handlers go with their own helpers, in source order: agent definitions to agent_definition_handlers.go, runs (with launchParent and launchRun, already on the helper-home allowlist for the suite handlers' use) to agent_run_handlers.go, the worker endpoints to worker_protocol_handlers.go, automations to automation_handlers.go, proposals to proposal_handlers.go, repo connections to repo_connection_handlers.go, provider settings to provider_settings_handlers.go, the provider CLI login broker to provider_login_handlers.go, and teams (crews) to crew_handlers.go. The last section, domain events (listOrg, ListDomainEvents), is in domain_event_handlers.go already. No helper is used by more than one of the new files, so none goes to a K3 home and the helper-home allowlist (M5) gains nothing. Preview with: go run ./internal/tools/declmove -n -spec internal/tools/declmove/specs/M7.json",
